{"id":"ln-l0-u1-01","track":"learner","pass_score":0.8,"title":{"ar":"الحروف: ا ب ت ث","en":"Letters: ا ب ت ث"},"teach":[{"type":"text","text":"Arabic is written and read from **right to left**. It has **28 letters**, no capital letters, and most letters connect to the next one. Let's learn the first 4."},{"type":"letter","ch":"ا","name":"alif","sound":"aa (long 'a', as in 'father')","note":"A plain vertical line. It never connects to the letter after it. At the start of a word it usually carries a small hamza (أ), as in أَسَد.","dots":"no dots","forms":{"iso":"ا","fin":"‍ا"},"word":{"ar":"أَسَد","en":"lion"}},{"type":"letter","ch":"ب","name":"baa","sound":"b","note":"A shallow bowl with one dot below.","dots":"one dot below","forms":{"iso":"ب","fin":"‍ب","ini":"ب‍","med":"‍ب‍"},"word":{"ar":"بَاب","en":"door"}},{"type":"letter","ch":"ت","name":"taa","sound":"t","note":"Same bowl as ب but two dots above.","dots":"two dots above","forms":{"iso":"ت","fin":"‍ت","ini":"ت‍","med":"‍ت‍"},"word":{"ar":"تُفَّاح","en":"apple"}},{"type":"letter","ch":"ث","name":"thaa","sound":"th (as in 'think')","note":"Same bowl, three dots above.","dots":"three dots above","forms":{"iso":"ث","fin":"‍ث","ini":"ث‍","med":"‍ث‍"},"word":{"ar":"ثَوْر","en":"bull"}},{"type":"tip","text":"Words that begin with a vowel sound start with أ (alif with a small hamza on top). It is still the letter alif."}],"practice":[{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Which letter is called «alif»?","options":["ث","ا","ت","ب"],"answer":1,"explain":"ا is called alif.","id":"ln-l0-u1-01_p1"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"What is the name of this letter: ب","options":["thaa","taa","alif","baa"],"answer":3,"explain":"ب is called baa.","id":"ln-l0-u1-01_p2"},{"type":"match","prompt":"Match each letter to its name","pairs":[["ا","alif"],["ب","baa"],["ت","taa"],["ث","thaa"]],"explain":"Look at the shape and the dots.","id":"ln-l0-u1-01_p3"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"The word تُفَّاح means:","options":["apple","bull","door","lion"],"answer":0,"explain":"تُفَّاح = apple. It starts with ت.","id":"ln-l0-u1-01_p4"}],"quiz":[{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Which letter makes this sound: th (as in 'think')","options":["ت","ب","ث","ا"],"answer":2,"explain":"ث (thaa) = th (as in 'think').","id":"ln-l0-u1-01_q1"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"How many dots does ب have, and where?","options":["One dot above","Three dots above","Two dots above","One dot below"],"answer":3,"explain":"ب has one dot below.","id":"ln-l0-u1-01_q2"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"What is the name of this letter: ت","options":["thaa","baa","alif","taa"],"answer":3,"explain":"ت is called taa.","id":"ln-l0-u1-01_q3"},{"type":"tf","prompt":"True or false: ا is called \"alif\".","answer":true,"explain":"Correct, ا is alif.","id":"ln-l0-u1-01_q4"},{"type":"type","prompt":"Type the name of this letter (in English letters): ث","answers":["thaa"],"explain":"ث is called thaa.","id":"ln-l0-u1-01_q5"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"The word بَاب means:","options":["bull","lion","apple","door"],"answer":3,"explain":"بَاب = door.","id":"ln-l0-u1-01_q6"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Which word starts with the letter ت?","options":["تُفَّاح","ثَوْر","بَاب","أَسَد"],"answer":0,"explain":"تُفَّاح (apple) starts with ت.","id":"ln-l0-u1-01_q7"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"What sound does ا make?","options":["aa (long 'a', as in 'father')","b","t","th (as in 'think')"],"answer":0,"explain":"ا (alif) = aa (long 'a', as in 'father').","id":"ln-l0-u1-01_q8"}]}